:0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.2.stable.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable.mono - macOS Unknown (27.0.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M5 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M5 Pro (15 threads) - 48.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe incorrect debug symbol folder structure prevents C# debug symbols from being read properly.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Export a C# project for iOS.\n2. Inspect the dSYM folder structure in the exported iOS project.\n  ```\n$ cd \"~/new-game-project/New Game Project/dylibs/ExportRelease/New Game Project_aot.xcframework/ios-arm64/dSYMs/\"\n$ tree \"New Game Project.framework.dSYM\"\nNew Game Project.framework.dSYM\n├── Info.plist\n├── New Game Project.dylib\n└── New Game Project.dylib.yml\n\n1 directory, 3 files\n  ```\n\n3. Attempt to read the dSYM using dwarfdump; it fails.  \n  ```\n$ dwarfdump --uuid \"New Game Project.framework.dSYM/\"\nerror: New Game Project.framework.dSYM/: expected directory 'Contents/Resources/DWARF' in dSYM bundle\n  ```\n\n4. Correct the dSYM folder structure.\n  ```\n$ cd \"New Game Project.framework.dSYM\" && \\\n  mkdir -p Contents/Resources/DWARF && \\\n  mv \"New Game Project.dylib\" \"Contents/Resources/DWARF/New Game Project\" && \\\n  mkdir -p Contents/Resources/Relocations/aarch64 && \\\n  mv Info.plist Contents/Info.plist && \\\n  mv \"New Game Project.dylib.yml\" \"Contents/Resources/Relocations/aarch64/New Game Project.yml\" && \\\n  cd ..\n\n$ tree \"New Game Project.framework.dSYM\"\nNew Game Project.framework.dSYM\n└── Contents\n    ├── Info.plist\n    └── Resources\n        ├── DWARF\n        │   └── New Game Project\n        └── Relocations\n            └── aarch64\n                └── New Game Project.yml\n\n6 directories, 3 files\n  ```\n\n5. Run dwarfdump again; it now reads the dSYM successfully.\n  ```\n$ dwarfdump --uuid \"New Game Project.framework.dSYM/\"\nUUID: 82DDE5B1-A4F5-3DCF-BE3A-02D93C580653 (arm64) New Game Project.framework.dSYM/Contents/Resources/DWARF/New Game Project\n  ```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124026/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124026/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}